## Elite main weapons (weapon convention, NOT the attach rule above)
ORIGIN = the exact centre of the GRIP; long axis along +Z from the grip (head/muzzle toward +Z), the "edge"/"front" faces +Y. Same grip cylinder rule as `kit_ch5_weapons_spec.md`. Each is the normal weapon from `blender_kit_ch5_weapons.py` made bigger and more broken: about 15% larger, more `crystal` spikes erupting, wider `crack_gold` cracks, a hovering detached chunk or two (joined), extra `magenta` glow gems. Exported to `Kit_W_<Name>.fbx`. Up to ~4500 tris each.
