8. `StarStaffPlus` (1.8 m; head +Z 1.4, butt -Z 0.4) — three crossed gold rings, a bigger star, 5 crystal orbs linked as a constellation.
9. `RuinMaulPlus` (1.7 m; head +Z 1.3, pommel -Z 0.4) — head = a bigger cracked block with a ring of violet crystal spikes bursting from the crack and a hovering chunk above.
